	"subtitle_audit": [
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "b93657c476943cf6fae91bc94f1545c6",
			"text": "先别急着上山，帮着把最后几包棉衣送过去。",
			"time": 10.0333333333333,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "275bdafa9d83d1b959d415d9a8c122bc",
			"text": "只剩三包了。先看看谁还没领到。",
			"time": 16.7,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "f563863a7a635304ed69b5bd3b6fcf8b",
			"text": "手都冻僵了……谢谢，你也把领口扣上。",
			"time": 27.4333333333339,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "小田"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "d5fff95c92e8c58afd84c1cc75c0157a",
			"text": "搁在我背包上吧。我先替他把绑腿系好。",
			"time": 52.2999999999996,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "老赵"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "6ff9d38b90d86dc24bb5df155feaf1fa",
			"text": "我这件还挡风。把这包送给后面那位同志吧。",
			"time": 76.6999999999982,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "许成"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "d8a6ce7fefbf0553d26d6f6bf97284d3",
			"text": "好，我替你送过去。",
			"time": 81.2333333333313,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "c21fdf4566fdb0f892e3981c52172791",
			"text": "我这一路都没暖过来。多谢，回头替我谢他。",
			"time": 91.5999999999974,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "阿木"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "e334ef178eb8eebcca74d85d9f6ad81c",
			"text": "发下去了？",
			"time": 101.699999999997,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "老战士"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "20815ec165875e9a9bab47ed9e021b5c",
			"text": "这三包都送到了。可后面还有人没领到。",
			"time": 104.499999999997,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "839c0ba0e87ca09ae03a9afef0f604f5",
			"text": "先顾着他们吧。山上风大，把包裹扎紧。",
			"time": 108.499999999996,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "老战士"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "3ab8d858b38a0e18b0eebab38ee82c30",
			"text": "您也穿厚一点。",
			"time": 113.733333333329,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "61a8f89458b4858226a4944f02102a6b",
			"text": "我再查一遍，就跟上。",
			"time": 116.499999999996,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "老战士"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "4279e6f2872ff7ffd80ae5e553b30eab",
			"text": "前面拐过弯，还有好长一队人。",
			"time": 120.466666666662,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "阿木"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "a6089b0099e7732991e4c057e85a0c0e",
			"text": "脚下慢点。我这边腾出手了，你跟着我走。",
			"time": 157.199999999994,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "老赵"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "09a55a258b44848d756bc0561ea76a95",
			"text": "前面的枝石压住路了。别挤，先把路让出来。",
			"time": 163.16666666666,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "622a9baa05481c778ccda7f3827fadc2",
			"text": "我来搬开这边的石头。后面先等等。",
			"time": 169.433333333326,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "5f83acd5f61e0864d208c59372bca61a",
			"text": "好了，顺着踩实的地方走。",
			"time": 173.199999999993,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "f2879919e4bb611df3d22b2f556a3905",
			"text": "风上来了！说话都听不清了！",
			"time": 194.466666666658,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "阿木"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "c5c117ae033ab3c5a339b0b7c4203df0",
			"text": "靠岩石避一避。前面看稳了，再招呼后面的同志。",
			"time": 197.699999999991,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "ead96832fe9f8256034bc60f8d57ca0f",
			"text": "刚才分到的棉衣真顶用。要不然这山上可难熬。",
			"time": 228.233333333323,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "小田"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "f6f1b17b256fbf3f59bdb3ba573465a0",
			"text": "这边背风，沿脚印过来！一个一个走！",
			"time": 253.066666666655,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "b38a496121cf4b580605c88a831af3f1",
			"text": "先在这儿歇口气，我点一下人。",
			"time": 310.100000000031,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "7adb4f103ae9bca00cfc92732cfb932d",
			"text": "那个管物资的老同志，谁看见了？",
			"time": 315.566666666702,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "7323c5e60c67655c7953806188a5c290",
			"text": "刚才还在后面，说要看看落下的包裹。",
			"time": 319.900000000039,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "小田"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "b29acf8c7d245429fd6adcb58cfc1512",
			"text": "我沿来路找。您照看队伍。",
			"time": 325.033333333376,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "8268fdb50efe90c04ebfae45ff4fe75f",
			"text": "别一个人走远，我随后过来。",
			"time": 328.500000000046,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "a7a337e8a040b9456232c7ff058ee519",
			"text": "这根扎带……是他挎包上的。",
			"time": 339.133333333388,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "389f80eebe396f8082c1c53eef698e38",
			"text": "前面的同志停下了！岩壁下，有位老同志……叫不应了。",
			"time": 345.033333333392,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "警卫员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "d9a84cb980f185fd63870ed1f5fccdb5",
			"text": "前面怎么停下了？队伍还得往前走！",
			"time": 355.366666666734,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "指挥员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "4590acb6e1a8fe9b653002ee0b030659",
			"text": "老同志？我们在上面等您。",
			"time": 358.90000000007,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "626743a49f85cb5ef4273667d1d002ca",
			"text": "您听见了吗……",
			"time": 363.000000000073,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "4b1cab2a97b18bcd3c48094422ebe0c8",
			"text": "这衣服，已经湿透了。",
			"time": 365.866666666742,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "b3bcc9f8285a66d0a115888197c73896",
			"text": "挎包还扣着。是山下那本记录。",
			"time": 369.300000000078,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "林川"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "44cc91f483a248a3e303077369f2171c",
			"text": "报告，人在这边。我们发现时，他已经没有回应了。",
			"time": 375.86666666675,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "警卫员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "ae1fdc59f4132dbf851f0ca16c053c9b",
			"text": "这么冷的天，他怎么只穿着单衣？",
			"time": 380.766666666754,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "指挥员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "a00ae1400d20af1d32c3f191376d01b2",
			"text": "把军需处长给我叫来！",
			"time": 386.300000000092,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "指挥员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "9c25d732019807ad015ad5c9dac7c828",
			"text": "御寒的衣物呢？为什么没送到他手上？",
			"time": 391.333333333429,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "指挥员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "e9ad407a79fba7459eca1fdf955010b9",
			"text": "怎么还站着？去叫他来，我要问清楚！",
			"time": 400.400000000103,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "指挥员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "1c6b34cdc1e2359cf7e373353a129118",
			"text": "他……就是军需处长。",
			"time": 409.033333333443,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "警卫员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "11aac24622f394c63af3c69b87c4374e",
			"text": "最后几包棉衣，是他让我们先送下去的。",
			"time": 422.233333333454,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "周班长"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "2bef97b7ff979f1a51ecff2a129262e5",
			"text": "他把衣物留给了大家……",
			"time": 427.066666666791,
			"volume_db": -3.0,
			"who": "指挥员"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "75f093fea5f1ae54781ecb4b88d36824",
			"text": "走吧，前面的同志还等着我们。",
			"time": 440.700000000135,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "阿木"
		},
		{
			"has_voice": true,
			"key": "d5ebac308523475204f7e686c4858a24",
			"text": "嗯。继续走。",
			"time": 444.400000000138,
			"volume_db": -1.0,
			"who": "林川"
		}
	],
